### plain at 100
tool sync: Sync the files.

Usage: tool sync [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --warn             Warn about something.
      --fail             Fail.
      --wait             Leave something pending.
      --throws           Throw.
      --json             Write one JSON document and nothing else for a person.
  -q, --quiet            Show only how it ended.
  -v, --verbose          Show every step as it happens.
      --[no-]color       Use colour where the terminal shows it (--no-color turns it off). (default: --color)
      --non-interactive  Never ask a question: where one is needed, fail and say so.
      --dry-run          Show what would change and change nothing.
      --check            Change nothing; end with findings where something would change.
  -h, --help             Show this help and do nothing else.

Effect: changes something (--dry-run shows what it would do; --check changes nothing and ends with findings where it would)
Repeating it: not promised to be safe
For: anyone

